<title>FRANCE: French stocks decline during Jospin speech.</title>
<headline>French stocks decline during Jospin speech.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>French stocks slip during Prime Minister Lionel Jospin's keynote policy speech to parliament.</p>
<p>The blue-chip CAC-40 index was down 1.37 points or 0.05 percent at 2,750.37 at 1337 GMT compared with 2,784.36 before the speech started.</p>
<p>The CAC-40 futures contract was unchanged at 2,748 compared with 2,783 at 1300 GMT.</p>
